    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŭbur</span></b> , f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in Spain</i>,
				<i>on the river Rubricatus</i>, perh. the mod.
			Villa Nuova, in Castile, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3,
				4, § 21</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sŭbūrĭtāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Subur</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
				Grut. 414, 3</span></i>.</div>
